OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval objects help tell Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry story
OL,5,
OL,6,FA collection of special objects with
OL,7,Fconnections to scenes in the Bayeux
OL,8,FTapestry is to go on display - aptly in
OL,9,Fa Norman castle.
OL,11,FTwenty-one items - including a rare
OL,12,Fsilver-gilt reliquary box - have been
OL,13,Floaned to Norwich Castle Museum by the
OL,14,FWyvern Collection in London, some of
OL,15,Fthem for the very first time.
OL,17,F"In the Bayeux Tapestry, you see King
OL,18,FHarold swearing an oath on reliquaries
OL,19,Fand we've got a reliquary that is
OL,20,Factually from the period," said curator
OL,21,FTim Pestell.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
