OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval objects help tell Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry story
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe aim is to "give a sense of how rich
OL,7,Fand complex the world in which they
OL,8,Fwere made for was", said Dr Susannah
OL,9,FKingwill, director of the Wyvern
OL,10,FResearch Institute.
